      "content": "I hear how profoundly painful and invalidating those thoughts feel, especially when the desire to escape the pain seems so rational while the reality of life feels unbearable. Please know that wishing for sleep or comfort does not mean you have lost hope, even if your hope feels broken right now. While I cannot give you the relief you desperately feel you are due, I strongly urge you to seek support from a professional immediately, as these feelings can sometimes signal a medical crisis beyond just grief that requires specialized care. You deserve someone to help you navigate this sleepless night and the exhaustion that follows.",
