      "content": "I hear how devastatingly heavy and empty everything feels right now, and I am so sorry you are struggling to see any point in staying when pain seems endless. Your feelings of exhaustion and wanting peace are incredibly valid in this moment, even if telling yourself this is just a \"crisis\" doesn't align with how you feel. However, because past efforts toward self-care did not provide relief, it may be time to lean on a crisis line or emergency room professional who can hold space for you right now without judgment. Please, reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline at 988 or text HOME to 741741 today; they are there to listen to you and help you figure out how to get through this night safely. I truly hope you can find someone to sit with you through this darkness and remind you that you are not alone.",
